Processant_aat_lu_arcs_arc_lu,         	"\nProcessing table of attributes of %lu arcs. Arc: %10lu"
Processant_pat_lu_pols_pol_lu,         	"\nProcessing table of attributes of %lu polygons. Polygon: %10lu"
Mida_registre_taula_ld_supera_ArcInfo,  "\nINFO equivalent record database size is %ld. It exceeds the ArcInfo record limit where a record most be up to 10000 bytes long.\nIt will not be possible to IMPORT the resulting file. Please, simplify the main table of the layer database."
Arc_lu_mes_de_501_vrt_No_Suport,	"\nArc %lu has more than 501 vertices. It exceeds the number-of-vertices-per-arc limit of ArcInfo.\nIt will not be possible to IMPORT the resulting file."
Pol_lu_mes_de_5000_arc_No_Suport,	"\nPolygon %lu has more than 5000 arcs. It exceeds the number-of-arcs-per-polygon limit of ArcInfo.\nIt will not be possible to IMPORT the resulting file."
Taula_registre_multiple_Nomes_darrer,   "Main table of the layer database has more than one record for a graphic identifier (multiple records). Only the last record of each graphic identifier will be exported to the E00 file."
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_00,              "This file contains arcs with 500 vertices or more. Although MiraMon can work"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_01,              "with practically un unlimited number of vertices per arc, ArcInfo does not"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_02,              "support arcs with 500 vertices or more (see the ArcInfo"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_03,              "documentation under \"Coverage Data Limitations\" for further information). In"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_04,              "order for ArcInfo or ArcView to be able to read the E00 resulting file, it is"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_05,              "necessary to go through a slow process of cutting all long arcs"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_06,              "(which avoid this limitation) followed by rebuilding the topology of the cover."
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_07,              "Please be patient."
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_08,              ""
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_09,              "You must bear in mind that the number of arcs and its geometric characteristics"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_10,              "may eventually be different now. For instance, an arc delimiting a polygon or a"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_11,              "road which was a single arc in MiraMon may now have"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_12,              "become more than one graphical object in ArcInfo due to this limitation of 500"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_13,              "vertices per arc. However, the exporting process will assign to each fragment"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_14,              "the corresponding thematic attributes of the original arc."
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_15,              ""
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_16,              "These changes do not modify neither the number of polygons nor their geometric"
Arc_amb_mes_de_500_vrt_17,              "and attribute characteristics."

/*Arcinfm2.c*/
