Trobat_pat_i_no_pol_No_genero_pol,	"Polygon attributes information has been found, but no information on vertex\ncoordinates. It is not possible to generate the POL file."
Trobat_tat_i_no_anotacions_No_genero_pnt, "annotation attributes information has been found, but no information on point\ncoordinates. It is not possible to generate the PNT file. "
Trobat_punts_i_no_pat_Genero_dbf_min,  	"Point coordinates information has been found, but no information on point\nattributes. A minimum attribute file T.dbf will be created."
Trobat_arcs_i_no_aat_Genero_dbf_min,   	"Arc coordinates information has been found, but no information on arc\nattributes. A minimum attribute file A.dbf will be created."
Trobat_pols_i_no_pat_Genero_dbf_min,   	"Polygon coordinates information has been found, but no information on polygon\nattributes. A minimum attribute file P.dbf will be created."
Trobat_anotacions_i_no_tat_Genero_dbf_min, "annotation coordinates information has been found, but no information\non attributes. A minimum attribute file T.dbf will be created."
Trobats_punts_i_pat_etiq_pol1,    	"Point coordinates information, presumably labels\ninside the polygons, has been found. With these"
Trobats_punts_i_pat_etiq_pol2,    	"labels and the arc file you can generate the polygon file again,\nusing the programs CICLAR and ATRIPOL. Anyway, there is"
Trobats_punts_i_pat_etiq_pol3,    	"no need to do it now because the output polygon file will have the same labels\nthat the point attribute file T.dbf has."
Trobats_pols_i_no_arc_Ignoro_pols,      "\n\aThere is information to generate a polygon file, but since there is no\ninformation on the arc coordinates, the result would be useless.\nPolygons table will be ignored."
