Nota_explicativa_llarga1,                 "The Export format is a format of ESRI Inc. intended to transfer data among ArcInfo platforms and, therefore, about which there exists little documentation, so this module may not work properly. "
Nota_explicativa_llarga2,                 "ArcInfMM is a simple application to quickly transform vector and raster coverages and it is based on codes found in Internet. "
Nota_explicativa_llarga3,                 "For this reason, we recommend using ArcInfo and MiraMon typical export and import functions "
Nota_explicativa_llarga4,                 "(UNGENERATE, GENERATE, DXFARC i ARCDXF for ArcInfo, and VecDXF and DXFVec, etc, for MiraMon) and vector structuring functions (CLEAN, BUILD, etc. for ArcInfo and CreaTop, etc, for MiraMon)."
Queden_caselles_buides_vols_valors_per_defecte_, "There are empty boxes. Do you want to continue with default values?"
